text ni1 "<h3>Open an issue</h3>\n<p>With Radicle, from a clone: <code>rad issue open</code>. Or here, without an account: the seed's node publishes it as a Radicle issue, labelled <code>web</code>, on its next cycle.</p>\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"/forge/intake\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"repo\" value=\""
